### Capture API scenario: a text capture, a photo capture, and the refused cases.
### Run the requests top to bottom (VS Code REST Client or Rider HTTP Client).
### Fill the two seed account values from user-secrets: Seed:SahipEmail / Seed:SahipPassword
### (and Seed:AsistanEmail / Seed:AsistanPassword for the 403 example). Do not commit real values.

@host = http://localhost:5051
@sahipEmail = <Seed:SahipEmail>
@sahipSifre = <Seed:SahipPassword>
@asistanEmail = <Seed:AsistanEmail>
@asistanSifre = <Seed:AsistanPassword>

# Client-made ids (Guid v7 style), so every POST below can be repeated safely.
@metinId = 019e1000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001
@fotoYakalamaId = 019e1000-0000-7000-8000-000000000002

### 1. Log in as Sahip
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/hesap/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{sahipEmail}}", "password": "{{sahipSifre}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Capture a text -> 201 (again with the same id -> 200, no second record)
POST {{host}}/api/yakalamalar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{metinId}}",
  "metin": "Kitap kulübü için yeni kitap önerisi sor",
  "hedef": "projects/kitap-kulubu",
  "yakalandiAt": "2026-11-04T10:00:00+03:00"
}

### 3. Upload a photo -> 201 { id, url }. Put the id into @fotografId below.
POST {{host}}/api/dosyalar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sinir

--sinir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="dosya"; filename="fis.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./fis.png
--sinir--

###
@fotografId = <id from request 3>

### 4. Capture with a photo only (no text) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/yakalamalar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{fotoYakalamaId}}",
  "fotografId": "{{fotografId}}",
  "yakalandiAt": "2026-11-04T12:30:00+03:00"
}

### 5. List, newest first (YakalandiAt). Filter: ?durum=bekliyor | beyneGitti | islendi
GET {{host}}/api/yakalamalar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/yakalamalar?durum=bekliyor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. One capture
GET {{host}}/api/yakalamalar/{{metinId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Update (only while durum is bekliyor). Changing or dropping the photo deletes the old file.
PUT {{host}}/api/yakalamalar/{{metinId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metin": "Kitap kulübü için yeni kitap önerisi sor (Cuma'ya kadar)",
  "hedef": "projects/kitap-kulubu",
  "yakalandiAt": "2026-11-04T10:00:00+03:00"
}

### 8. Refused: no text and no photo -> 400 { errors: { metin: [...] } }
POST {{host}}/api/yakalamalar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "yakalandiAt": "2026-11-04T10:00:00+03:00" }

### 9. Refused: bad target -> 400 { errors: { hedef: [...] } }
POST {{host}}/api/yakalamalar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "metin": "x", "hedef": "projects/../finans", "yakalandiAt": "2026-11-04T10:00:00+03:00" }

### 10. Refused: missing client time -> 400 { errors: { yakalandiAt: [...] } }
POST {{host}}/api/yakalamalar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "metin": "x" }

### 11. Delete (also deletes the photo file) -> 204. A capture that already went to the brain -> 409.
DELETE {{host}}/api/yakalamalar/{{fotoYakalamaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Assistant without the yakalama.oku permission -> 403
# @name asistanLogin
POST {{host}}/api/hesap/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{asistanEmail}}", "password": "{{asistanSifre}}" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/yakalamalar
Authorization: Bearer {{asistanLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
